Input: {"question": "When was Guerin High School established?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d00", "start": 0, "end": 151, "text": "Guerin College Preparatory High School Guerin Preparatory High School is a private, Roman Catholic high school in River Grove, Illinois, United States."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d00", "start": 152, "end": 211, "text": "It is located in the Roman Catholic Archdiocese of Chicago."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d00", "start": 212, "end": 359, "text": "Guerin was established in 1962 as Mother Theodore Guerin High School, an all-girls school, by the Sisters of Providence of Saint Mary-of-the-Woods."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d00", "start": 360, "end": 456, "text": "The sisters named the school after their congregation's foundress, Saint Mother Theodore Guerin."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d00", "start": 457, "end": 609, "text": "The school was renamed when it became coeducational in 2004 and absorbed the students from the all-male Holy Cross High School after that school closed."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d00", "start": 610, "end": 651, "text": "Holy Cross High School had been opened in"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 0, "end": 11, "text": "1 million ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 12, "end": 106, "text": "Groundbreaking ceremonies took place on April 15 , 1962 , with Monsignor McManus officiating ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 107, "end": 233, "text": "Since the new building would not be ready for occupancy until the fall of 1963 , a wing of Holy Cross High School was rented ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 234, "end": 290, "text": "More than 300 freshmen began classes in September 1962 ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 291, "end": 366, "text": "Bishop Cletus O ’ Donnell presided at the laying of the cornerstone on Aug."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 367, "end": 391, "text": "24 , 1963 , and on Sept."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 392, "end": 464, "text": "9 , classes began in the new building with 796 freshmen and sophomores ."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d01", "start": 465, "end": 531, "text": "Cardinal Meyer blessed and dedicated the school and the convent on"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d02", "start": 0, "end": 1, "text": "."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d02", "start": 2, "end": 178, "text": "In addition to the laptop program , Guerin Prep also has a special program for honors students as well as a structured course of study for students needing special assistance ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d02", "start": 179, "end": 340, "text": "Guerin Prep is especially proud of its 22-acre campus , which provides fields and facilities enabling all athletes to practice in a safe and secure environment ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d02", "start": 341, "end": 486, "text": "Sponsored by the Sisters of Providence , Guerin Prep was founded as an all-girls school in 1962 and changed its mission to co-education in 2004 ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0052-3b692cd5f892:d02", "start": 487, "end": 576, "text": "Guerin Prep proudly claims both Mother Theodore Guerin and Holy Cross high schools as its"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4,